# Clean URL for the privacy notice.
#
# Vite emits it as /privacy.html. Cloudflare Pages already serves that at
# /privacy on its own, but this makes the path work the same way whatever is
# serving the site — and a legal notice is the wrong page to discover a
# 404 on. 200, not 301: rewrite in place rather than bounce the visitor.
/privacy   /privacy.html   200
